      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "aN",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "ONE PASS OVER ENTRIES, level by level\nBFS order: a depth level is a contiguous run whose\nparents all sit in the level above -> big levels\nsplit across threads, a heap per worker\nper row: own = scores[name]; carried = max(own, parent's)\n  lexical: idf x max(own, 0.5 x ancestors), x coverage^2,\n  - 0.01/level, x0.5 under worktree dirs,\n  siblings with no own match share one score\n  semantic (files only): (2 s(name) + 0.5 s(parent)\n  + 0.5 A(parent)) / stored centroid length\nlocal: 5-9 ms (was 16-42 before levels + caching)",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 938757389,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "text": "ONE PASS OVER ENTRIES, level by level\nBFS order: a depth level is a contiguous run whose\nparents all sit in the level above -> big levels\nsplit across threads, a heap per worker\nper row: own = scores[name]; carried = max(own, parent's)\n  lexical: idf x max(own, 0.5 x ancestors), x coverage^2,\n  - 0.01/level, x0.5 under worktree dirs,\n  siblings with no own match share one score\n  semantic (files only): (2 s(name) + 0.5 s(parent)\n  + 0.5 A(parent)) / stored centroid length\nlocal: 5-9 ms (was 16-42 before levels + caching)",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "updated": 1792604944177,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 154395487,
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
